    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The rows are fine as linked to none, with state cannot_determine. The text's statement that the 12- and 6-block variants show higher FD and KL than the 24-block model holds for 12 blocks but not for 6 blocks (82.05 < 85.20 FD; 0.928 < 0.941 KL). The text also states 10k training steps in the setup but 100k elsewhere. The Kaplan 6ND FLOPs heuristic is used only as a cost estimate, not as a version of the claim."
